'''Cherubi''' (Japanese: '''チェリンボ''' ''Cherinbo'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

