==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Cherubi|96}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*'''Sweets Relay''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Appletun|7}}, {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Vanillite|18}}, {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Vanillish|19}}, {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Swirlix|31}}, {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Slurpuff|32}}, and {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Milcery|36}} from the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

